nyGeometry)).s K B f T w) → (∀ K B f T w Z Wt p0 t nch n xd c, Ng K B f T w Z Wt p0 t nch n xd c → Nonempty (N K B f T w Z Wt p0 t nch n xd c) ∧ GoodO (w.D Z) nch xd) → MemberE (prmR N SExt.none (geoCl anyGeometry)).s := by
